<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Health Systems Intl upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Health Systems Intl upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Joe France upgraded Health Systems International Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/4 to 29.</p>
